  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market study report Nigeria Health Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to:&#x2022;	Gain a better understanding of the opportunities presented by the changing context of the Nigerian health sector post-COVID-19;&#x2022;	Develop a roadmap for collaboration between Nigerian and Dutch companies, government and knowledge institutes in the HealthTech and primary healthcare field, taking local context and Dutch expertise into account; &#x2022;	Gain a better understanding of the opportunities in the Nigerian health sector post-COVID-19;&#x2022;	Define funding, business and operating models to improve access and quality of healthcare in Nigeria through the use of information technology systems, devices, intelligence and applications; &#x2022;	Position The Netherlands as an innovative partner for the Life Sciences and Health (LSH) transition process and facilitate partnership opportunities between the Dutch Topsector LSH and the Private Sector Health Alliance of Nigeria (PSHAN).</narrative>
  </description>
